sequenceDiagram
    participant Temporal as Temporal (DataExtractionWorkflow)
    participant Extract as ExtractDataActivity
    participant Extractor as BaseExtractor (7 Domains)
    participant Adapter as SourceAdapter
    participant Transform as TransformDataActivity (PipelineOrchestrator)
    participant Publish as PublishDataActivity
    participant Recon as ReconciliationWorkflow

    Temporal->>Extract: Executar nó do DAG (por nível topológico)
    Extract->>Extractor: extract(AuthorizedContext, ResourceDescriptor)
    Extractor->>Extractor: Validar INV-001 (consentimento ativo) e INV-002 (escopo)
    Extractor->>Adapter: Consultar dados consentidos do domínio
    Adapter-->>Extractor: Registros brutos
    Extractor-->>Extract: RawData
    Temporal->>Transform: transform(RawData) em lote/unitário
    Transform->>Transform: Canonicalize -> Validate (INV-007) -> Quality -> PII Mask -> Lineage (INV-003)
    Transform-->>Temporal: Registros mascarados + lineageIds
    Temporal->>Publish: publish(maskedRecords, lineageIds)
    Publish-->>Temporal: Publicado (data.published.v1) + publicationId vinculado à linhagem
    Temporal->>Recon: Acionar reconciliação pós-extração (ReconcileActivity)
